# x402-TON POC — Environment Variables

# Your 24-word mnemonic for W5R1 wallet (client only)
TON_WALLET_MNEMONIC="word1 word2 word3 word4 word5 word6 word7 word8 word9 word10 word11 word12 word13 word14 word15 word16 word17 word18 word19 word20 word21 word22 word23 word24"

# Your wallet address (derived from mnemonic, for reference)
TON_WALLET_ADDRESS="UQ..."
TON_WALLET_RAW="0:..."
TON_WALLET_PUBKEY=""

# Seller/payee wallet address (where payments go)
TON_PAYEE_ADDRESS="0:your_payee_wallet_raw_address"

# TONAPI key (optional, increases rate limits)
# Get one at https://tonconsole.com
TONAPI_KEY=""
